# A mental model on a real object: the work table is a robot; each part carries one composed model.
# Source: owner, session D64-D66; chat 2 T25-T29 (Eagle, Owl, rooms, control panel).
LANGUAGE RSOS 0.2
WORLD workday
HOST person KIND human CHANNELS visual, auditory, kinesthetic STATES associated, owl, eagle
USE HOST person
CONSENT person FOR practice, cues BY person
BASELINE person
HOUSE mind FOR person
ROOM eagle PERSPECTIVE above IN mind
ROOM associated_room PERSPECTIVE inside IN mind
OBJECT robot KIND work_table IN eagle
PART robot.head KIND decision_model
PART robot.hand KIND action_model
MODEL robot.head = associated + confidence + analogical_reasoning IN eagle FOR decision
MODEL robot.hand = top_view + dissociated + future_pacing + action IN eagle FOR action
OBJECT couch KIND furniture IN eagle REPRESENTS langgraph
DEDICATE couch TO hypothesis_testing
FORM couch DIRECTIONS forward -> hypothesis ; backward -> contradiction ; up -> framing ; down -> operational_test
MATERIAL couch = user_interface
OBJECT eagle_calculator KIND symbol
ANCHOR eagle_calculator TO robot.head CHANNEL kinesthetic
CUE eagle CODE "-.." CHANNEL kinesthetic
FUTUREPACE eagle_calculator SCENARIOS 3
USE STATE eagle
SELECTMODEL robot.head BY choice
OPEN eagle_calculator FROM kinesthetic SCOPE whole
